{"3389460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Tears: Angola", "steam_appid": 3389460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Bush Warfare in an Open World Historical setting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Tears: Angola </strong>is a fast-paced and immersive stealth-action first person shooter. Take advantage of your tools and environment to surprise and survive against outnumbering odds. <br><br>Welcome to Angola in the late 1970s. As a  fighter surviving in a hostile open world, avoid dynamic patrols and attack outposts for intel, resources and conquer alongside your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/17d49b4cb60e5196c7cffb2c64ef733c.poster.avif?t=1787200767\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/17d49b4cb60e5196c7cffb2c64ef733c.webm?t=1787200767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/17d49b4cb60e5196c7cffb2c64ef733c.mp4?t=1787200767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Factions - UNITA, MPLA (SADF, Cuba and Portugal to come in Future Updates)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach with each encounter - stealth or loud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Takedown animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Cold War era weapons &amp; gadgets, with jamming &amp; crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear Open World with chaotic AI Skirmishes &amp; Faction Conquest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassination Targets roaming the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturable Outposts and smaller locations which can change hands dynamically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events - (Patrols, Hostages, Cargo etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intel Gathering System &amp; Map Fog of War.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Continuation Respawn Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense Foliage, hide in shrubs, climb trees and avoid snakes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable difficulty settings - Adjust Global damage output and AI Difficulty to suit your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More is planned!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/05b0779dde79673a1741b19aab9caae7.avif?t=1787200767\" width=1560 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Bush Warfare in an Open World Historical setting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Tears: Angola </strong>is a fast-paced and immersive stealth-action first person shooter. Take advantage of your tools and environment to surprise and survive against outnumbering odds. <br><br>Welcome to Angola in the late 1970s. As a  fighter surviving in a hostile open world, avoid dynamic patrols and attack outposts for intel, resources and conquer alongside your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/17d49b4cb60e5196c7cffb2c64ef733c.poster.avif?t=1787200767\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/17d49b4cb60e5196c7cffb2c64ef733c.webm?t=1787200767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/17d49b4cb60e5196c7cffb2c64ef733c.mp4?t=1787200767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Factions - UNITA, MPLA (SADF, Cuba and Portugal to come in Future Updates)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach with each encounter - stealth or loud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Takedown animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Cold War era weapons &amp; gadgets, with jamming &amp; crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear Open World with chaotic AI Skirmishes &amp; Faction Conquest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassination Targets roaming the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capturable Outposts and smaller locations which can change hands dynamically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events - (Patrols, Hostages, Cargo etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intel Gathering System &amp; Map Fog of War.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Continuation Respawn Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense Foliage, hide in shrubs, climb trees and avoid snakes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable difficulty settings - Adjust Global damage output and AI Difficulty to suit your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More is planned!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diegetic UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/extras/05b0779dde79673a1741b19aab9caae7.avif?t=1787200767\" width=1560 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Red Tears is a dynamic Stealth-Action FPS set within a non-linear Open-World featuring brutal bush warfare. Employ guerrilla tactics, strike from the shadows, and endure violent gunfights to survive. Gather intel, loot resources, and fight boots on the ground in this Cold War-Era conflict.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/6e12eb977f54a3d78da2952d9c482e068b623cba/header.jpg?t=1787200767", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/f2c2143965ed08d7c95254e8f480e9f6c9d2c4a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787200767", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389460/f2c2143965ed08d7c95254e8f480e9f6c9d2c4a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787200767", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz or faster.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These requirements may not be fully accurate.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Arun Haines"], "publishers": ["Arun Haines"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [1199207], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Red Tears: Angola", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1199207, "percent_